<description>Trained for 'Out Of Bounds' by looking for addresses going from 0 to 1 when the car goes off the course.  Eventually found it  Set Break on read on this address. Branch instruction checks if it is 0 or 1 Changed the load instruction which queries this flag to a Load Immediate with zero so you are never out or bounds.</description>
